msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaH743v4.rst:73
#: c3e63d0c1f634e4db2f9f137b55ad4a7
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\" by default, and:"
